(Get-FileHash wp-portal-v<x.y.z>.zip).Hash -eq (-split (Get-Content SHA256SUMS))[0] prints True for an intact zip,
where the line before showed the hash to compare with SHA256SUMS by eye (owner, 28-10-2026).

